<title>JAPAN: Fuji Bank to issue preferred stock - paper.</title>
<headline>Fuji Bank to issue preferred stock - paper.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuji Bank Ltd has decided to issue preferred stock worth about 150 billion yen, possibly as early as November, the Japanese daily Yomiuri Shimbun reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>The move is aimed at boosting its capital, and the issue is likely to be made in the Euromarket, the paper said.</p>
<p>Comments from the bank were not immediately available.</p>
